{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0255_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0255_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "4597ab43fcae7fb85950d5184a203db9763f6bb9ffeec11bd3c852eb4d6b6560", "ja": "絶対無敵のマジカルパワー☆", "zh": "绝对无敌的魔法力量☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0255_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0255_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "cc4a41a2548f8846d86809f0d1a08a43726083094b76cff2dcfa6d201519410e", "ja": "土くれの巨人は亜美の魔法だった。巨人に\n取り込まれてしまった亜美を助けたい真美に\n「わたしと可奈に任せて」と言う翼。亜美、\nそして真美のため、可奈は翼と力をあわせ\n巨人めがけて自らの封印魔法を発動する。", "zh": "泥土巨人其实是亚美的魔法。面对想要\n拯救被巨人吞噬的亚美的真美，翼对她说\n“交给我和可奈吧”。为了亚美，也是为了\n真美，可奈与翼合力朝向巨人发动了自己的封印魔法。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0255_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0255_story_05_1000_036kan", "source_sha256": "91223b8cc8fa6a3f9c0eb2125e911e4fd4ba9b6438a68eb5f53fca16d3e25616", "ja": "古の秘術と言われる、土の巨人……\n古代魔法に詳しい亜美さんなら、対処法を……。", "zh": "据说是古代秘术的土之巨人……精通古代魔法的亚美小姐，应该知道应对方法……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0255_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0255_story_05_1001_016tsu", "source_sha256": "f363fe02294a75b8528d6431259d419572b653e4dbcf2d6601c1cfe41e4c8c3d", "ja": "ダメですよ、真美センセイ！", "zh": "不行，真美老师！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0255_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0255_story_05_1002_012mam", "source_sha256": "9906a4780b781ce32cb15c7454e9fcc301432a6d3117b03b4bad42a95903e4e2", "ja": "でも！　このままじゃ、亜美が……！", "zh": "可是！这样下去，亚美她……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0255_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0255_story_05_1003_036kan", "source_sha256": "6ab6b0205502e8c342d4bf9def40692dfe0f25a91a6d7e11fbccadf8479cb75c", "ja": "！　この声は……翼！？", "zh": "！这个声音是……翼！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0255_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0255_story_05_1004_036kan", "source_sha256": "35444afb56a33cffa655b3036ebe4df0b4e9d99c921511facd12a4cb0ff6cfff", "ja": "翼！　真美先生も、無事でよかった！\n外で、土の巨人が暴れてるんです！　亜美さんは……。", "zh": "翼！真美老师也平安无事，太好了！\n外面有个土巨人在大闹呢！亚美她……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0255_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0255_story_05_1005_012mam", "source_sha256": "703fdf3380b5727101a50000fc3a9c88707fce1c3abe6435539ff8672570d279", "ja": "……。\n亜美は……巨人の中に取り込まれて……。", "zh": "……。\n亚美她……被吸进巨人里面了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0255_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0255_story_05_1006_036kan", "source_sha256": "5cc490dcece6504e352e08cb90ee21d4372641436aecc1e2cbf05371693482f3", "ja": "ええっ！？　それじゃ、あの巨人を動かしているのは、\n亜美さんの魔法……！？", "zh": "诶！？这么说，操纵那个巨人的，就是\n亚美的魔法……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0255_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0255_story_05_1007_012mam", "source_sha256": "4fd0743da59872eea7c0715a875f45994d9de4245b9116b828c45a0b6a2ad093", "ja": "わかってたのに……何も、できなかった……。\nお願い……亜美を、助けて……！", "zh": "明明都知道的……却什么、都做不到……\n求求你们……救救、亚美吧……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0255_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0255_story_05_1008_016tsu", "source_sha256": "d7255cd29e5ca30abe1df1bcd66041e434e75c547010757e958ea6a0ab86784d", "ja": "大丈夫だよ、真美センセイ！\nわたしと可奈にまかせて！", "zh": "没事的，真美老师！\n交给我和可奈吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0255_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0255_story_05_1009_036kan", "source_sha256": "42a16f64ab4b860adfaf5f9c9e10bdfde5d540cc6ab5f618f8db1a12e69a9740", "ja": "！　アンタ……！", "zh": "！你这家伙……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0255_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0255_story_05_1010_016tsu", "source_sha256": "a9bc820fc78b1e8568245880e2b72a4e36010637db38a79868d3682c2d65aacf", "ja": "あっ、勝手に約束しちゃった！　けど……\n可奈、お願い！　亜美ちゃんを助けるの、手伝って！", "zh": "啊，擅自跟人家约好了！不过……\n可奈，拜托了！帮我一起去救亚美吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0255_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0255_story_05_1011_036kan", "source_sha256": "ef5daa82bd84f78eb061bf3826c452649987f556577c62899795eb59b17da492", "ja": "……『どんな困難にも、\n共に手を取り立ち向かうこと』……。", "zh": "……“无论遇到什么困难，\n都要携手面对”……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0255_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0255_story_05_1012_036kan", "source_sha256": "2db0368a62cd18d4bbd426cd7f0e8a42594ca9eb43ed900d05a9f450cd9a267c", "ja": "まったく……呆れちゃうわ。\nなんで、よりによってアンタなのかしら。", "zh": "真是的……都让人无语了。\n为什么偏偏会是你啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0255_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0255_story_05_1013_016tsu", "source_sha256": "d06754a447221c7890d537d76cf0ee1d4fd941d7f0daa0e1b27a97763fb2b41e", "ja": "も～～、パートナーの話なら後で！\n勉強もがんばるし、可奈の話も聞く！　だから……", "zh": "哎～～，搭档的事之后再说啦！\n我会好好学习，也会听可奈说的！所以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0255_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0255_story_05_1014_036kan", "source_sha256": "936d3de41021889d2e6f13e078442ff79c6439cb704e89087fc5d380c3edb7a4", "ja": "聞き分けがよくて結構。それじゃあ、追加よ。\n『戦う時は、私のそばにいること』。……いい？", "zh": "很会听话，不错。那就再加一条。‘战斗时，要待在我身边。’……可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0255_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0255_story_05_1015_016tsu", "source_sha256": "44085dbcb5e156a3b5dbebaad9e90bf500353e21f940ddabc45cc9c85d0a3697", "ja": "……！　うん、わかった！\n絶対、約束する！", "zh": "……！嗯，我知道了！\n我绝对会遵守约定的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0255_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0255_story_05_1016_012mam", "source_sha256": "abc3962bd6682d34fc068709f17dfa3dc92667cab212c0a5c4be96b88db0da7d", "ja": "可奈……翼……。", "zh": "可奈……翼……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0255_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0255_story_05_1017_036kan", "source_sha256": "63f1873c2ec8c30d4595de682a729e632040763c493f912817d8c385cfed96f9", "ja": "真美先生、サポートをお願いします！\n……絶対に、亜美さんを助けてみせますから！", "zh": "真美老师，请帮忙支援！\n……我一定会救出亚美的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0255_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0255_story_05_1018_036kan", "source_sha256": "0abc6c0db10da9238b8e0d9f2f169126592ca9ab249b2b8bdbebfa608e6f8523", "ja": "行くわよ、翼！　相手は世界を平らにした古の巨人……\n踏み潰されないように、ここから封じる！", "zh": "走吧，翼！对方是把世界踏平的远古巨人……在这里将它封印，别让它把我们踩扁！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0255_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0255_story_05_1019_016tsu", "source_sha256": "f1bb0e7a45114e67c1b58335ef20306e2cc423e9412d9d856ff070392823015f", "ja": "うん！　ここでわたし達ががんばらないと、\nこの世界がなくなっちゃうんでしょ？", "zh": "嗯！要是我们不在这里加油的话，这个世界就会消失，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0255_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0255_story_05_1020_016tsu", "source_sha256": "202a5815fe5bf971ae442d1309c4e94145a82b3a8c3e989cfd5b0eec5a079025", "ja": "そんなこと、絶対にさせないもんね！", "zh": "绝对不会让那种事发生的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0255_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0255_story_05_1021_016tsu", "source_sha256": "1c991e27c3a78db86921e3dc6b40b93f4a55b942d27e0d608766f8e2c5a8d78d", "ja": "可奈、力を合わせて！\nわたしとアンタで、世界を……救うよ！", "zh": "可奈，齐心协力！\n我和你一起，把这个世界……拯救出来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0255_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0255_story_05_1022_036kan", "source_sha256": "655ec38f1bbaa7b7cde362a02f2871a04460fc22750a845af3003ac65684e46d", "ja": "うるさいわね！　言われなくても、やってやる！\nアンタこそ、私に合わせなさいよ！", "zh": "吵死啦！就算你不说，我也会出手的！\n你才该好好配合我呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0255_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0255_story_05_1023_036kan", "source_sha256": "0012ac66a1bd41d10200b3437d89f28625311709e9bc69fc22f0e70d749f1044", "ja": "大気中のマナを集めて……いくわよ！\n封印魔法……発動！！", "zh": "汇聚大气中的玛娜……要上啦！\n封印魔法……发动！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
